Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
media/IMG_*.jpg
poems/*.docx
poems/*.txt.bak
# Excel's lock files, left behind while a workbook is open
~$*
# The DNS site list is the raw source for the two lookup tools. They read the
# extracted data.json, so the 3 MB workbook itself never needs publishing.
tools/site-access/*.xlsx

# Source workbooks. The repository is public and GitHub Pages serves it, so a
# design sheet committed here is a design sheet published at emortia.com —
# 245 sites with their coordinates, vendors and planned builds. They stay on
# the machine that needs them.
samples/

# SheetJS, vendored so the parser tests can run under node. See
# tools/design-extractor/README.md for the one line that fetches it.
.tools/

# A design workbook dropped in for the parser tests. Everything here is served,
# so keeping one in the repo would publish a Dialog design sheet.
.work/
